Usage: agent-deck group show <name> [--resolved] [--json]

Show a group's settings.

Options:
  -json
    	Output as JSON
  -q	Minimal output (short)
  -quiet
    	Minimal output
  -resolved
    	Resolve the effective claude config for this group (sources included)

Examples:
  agent-deck group show work
  agent-deck group show work --resolved
  agent-deck group show work --resolved --json
